'The structural-section libraries provide tabulated geometric properties and transparent property-threshold screening.
'They do not select a member, assign material strength, establish design capacity, or replace verification against the governing AISC edition.

"Wide-Flange W Sections

'#### Dataset Summary

ShowAiscWDatasetSummary$

'#### Selected Section

#hide
selected_w = W14X90
#show

ShowAiscWRecord$(selected_w)

ShowAiscWProperties$(selected_w)

'#### Property Screening

#hide
w_minimum_Sx = 140in^3
w_candidates = AiscWItemsAtLeast(AISC_W_P_SX; w_minimum_Sx)
w_candidate_count = len(w_candidates)
#show

'There are 'w_candidate_count' W sections with Sx at least 'w_minimum_Sx'.

"Hollow Structural Sections

'#### Dataset Summary

ShowAiscHssDatasetSummary$

'#### Selected Section

#hide
selected_hss = HSS12X8X3_8
#show

ShowAiscHssRecord$(selected_hss)

ShowAiscHssProperties$(selected_hss)

'#### Property Screening

#hide
hss_minimum_Sx = 40in^3
hss_candidates = AiscHssItemsAtLeast(AISC_HSS_P_SX; hss_minimum_Sx)
hss_candidate_count = len(hss_candidates)
#show

'There are 'hss_candidate_count' HSS sections with Sx at least 'hss_minimum_Sx'.

"Standard and Miscellaneous Channels

'#### Dataset Summary

ShowAiscChannelDatasetSummary$

'#### Selected Section

#hide
selected_channel = MC12X50
#show

ShowAiscChannelRecord$(selected_channel)

ShowAiscChannelProperties$(selected_channel)

'#### Property Screening

#hide
channel_minimum_Sx = 20in^3
channel_candidates = AiscChannelItemsAtLeast(AISC_CHANNEL_P_SX; channel_minimum_Sx)
channel_candidate_count = len(channel_candidates)
#show

'There are 'channel_candidate_count' C and MC channels with Sx at least 'channel_minimum_Sx'.

"Single Angles

'#### Dataset Summary

ShowAiscAngleDatasetSummary$

'#### Selected Section

#hide
selected_angle = L12X12X1
#show

ShowAiscAngleRecord$(selected_angle)

ShowAiscAngleProperties$(selected_angle)

'#### Property Screening

#hide
angle_minimum_Sx = 15in^3
angle_candidates = AiscAngleItemsAtLeast(AISC_ANGLE_P_SX; angle_minimum_Sx)
angle_candidate_count = len(angle_candidates)
#show

'There are 'angle_candidate_count' single angles with Sx at least 'angle_minimum_Sx'.

"Conclusions

'All screening results are geometric filters only. Apply material properties, unbraced lengths, limit states, resistance factors, and project-specific requirements separately.
